{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/alarm.dart:offset-6791", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/alarm.dart", "location": "offset-6791", "text": "'Changing the schedule, testing and cancelling all '\n'write to the band, so they need a live '\n'connection. An alarm that is already armed is '\n'unaffected — it lives on the band.'", "sha256": "1b813bac4a9c3eb276e3c25a3434cd8b1e5a791c122ce90da546d4de862e0cfa", "kind": "dart", "start": 6791, "end": 7055, "line": 170}
