{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/alarm.dart:offset-15246", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/alarm.dart", "location": "offset-15246", "text": "'The write reached the band. Its confirmation usually arrives within '\n'a few seconds.'", "sha256": "b79ddb461865be95ebbf467ccd46016837c7769229a146d00422277c251a92c3", "kind": "dart", "start": 15246, "end": 15347, "line": 370}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/alarm.dart:offset-15415", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/alarm.dart", "location": "offset-15415", "text": "'The time above is what this app last sent. The band never confirmed '\n'it — or it was set in an earlier run of the app, and there is no '\n'way to ask the band what it is holding. Set it again while '\n'connected if you need to be sure.'", "sha256": "ccf0a00ebf4dac514efbaf457de4126691129c706acdcacb70abff327afcbf68", "kind": "dart", "start": 15415, "end": 15693, "line": 373}
