{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-5066", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-5066", "text": "'No app has notified you yet'", "sha256": "f8d1fe0a17cdc8c60fa651c7da9da364ded92c3d4872bbc8e8bf40ff3099be64", "kind": "dart", "start": 5066, "end": 5095, "line": 139}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-5454", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-5454", "text": "'Apps appear here the first time each one notifies you '\n'while the relay is on. Nothing is missed in the '\n'meantime — the first ping is what puts an app on this '\n'list, and the second can buzz.'", "sha256": "7d3de4f549896513b10a01e9e4716485829671dbe85d37b8b4b5cf7db51ca957", "kind": "dart", "start": 5454, "end": 5717, "line": 146}
