{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-6787", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-6787", "text": "\"When Android's own pattern cannot be read, the fallback \"\n'rhythm below is used. The band plays one buzz per pulse, up '\n'to three — not the exact rhythm.'", "sha256": "ba3664632f3c74ef4740feaba36f17f585fb3c5a86ae2ff5b8c855c3ff6d7b7b", "kind": "dart", "start": 6787, "end": 6975, "line": 177}
