{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-7344", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-7344", "text": "'Buzz during Do Not Disturb'", "sha256": "c77c58397e32f6c021a63ef021e9054f9d67905d906562536340727ccfa637d4", "kind": "dart", "start": 7344, "end": 7372, "line": 188}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-7496", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-7496", "text": "'Calls respect Do Not Disturb unless you switch this on. '\n'Edge never changes your Do Not Disturb setting.'", "sha256": "6c3a2d8ce19884c5e741a682a2b39ef50eaf8b0fb04eed033e56280f98a6b6d3", "kind": "dart", "start": 7496, "end": 7622, "line": 191}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-7639", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-7639", "text": "'Off respects Do Not Disturb. Edge never changes your Do '\n'Not Disturb setting.'", "sha256": "3bd68ce5902d5e03d628331b1e788c57572f40161483e2d5184b5e9b18758a1a", "kind": "dart", "start": 7639, "end": 7738, "line": 193}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-7757", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-7757", "text": "'Buzz in vibrate mode'", "sha256": "f00a6fbc3f763196a5d5aa33d980f710890055369411d67e5be0cfc3fcc98b01", "kind": "dart", "start": 7757, "end": 7779, "line": 195}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-7873", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-7873", "text": "'Buzz in silent mode'", "sha256": "4fd80e225080d4d3242fc637ee8b93669343ac44aea39472c27487384964cd72", "kind": "dart", "start": 7873, "end": 7894, "line": 197}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-7986", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-7986", "text": "'Only while worn'", "sha256": "a634d8232b965694ecbe82aabd8bd9acc972aebec46c28bb6f0cf80d6c33e183", "kind": "dart", "start": 7986, "end": 8003, "line": 199}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-8093", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-8093", "text": "'If wear cannot be confirmed, nothing buzzes.'", "sha256": "d62a8b67dd97d6192cd30114f59c0b6c818accdf8e1f2955a76b56f1057037c3", "kind": "dart", "start": 8093, "end": 8139, "line": 201}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-8158", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-8158", "text": "'Phone alert if the band is away'", "sha256": "dfc9c5283e7d5714ececd7f14897d28f0fa4a24d4a8447dd8abe79896f4a1458", "kind": "dart", "start": 8158, "end": 8191, "line": 202}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-8281", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-8281", "text": "'A generic notice on this phone when the band is not '\n'connected. It follows the Do Not Disturb choice above.'", "sha256": "5a541b1e0c6854e1ef56750bb8f2aa14ea7388aee316f4bdabc3a4abd266cbf7", "kind": "dart", "start": 8281, "end": 8406, "line": 204}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-8436", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-8436", "text": "'Quiet hours'", "sha256": "fbb959095058f5ad6ff94f651170b207bfd0e4ef8b6df78c8d4ffbb944a3967b", "kind": "dart", "start": 8436, "end": 8449, "line": 207}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-9819", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-9819", "text": "'Band notifications'", "sha256": "d19e30decc55dd02b49f42bbd13457257140f319ac2605853d2b7a6741c560c9", "kind": "dart", "start": 9819, "end": 9839, "line": 241}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-9884", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-9884", "text": "'WHAT MAKES THE STRAP BUZZ'", "sha256": "68af5daf1d9520433d1b614994897d9a68a0cc21f66d76c8bcd10ae1068ba011", "kind": "dart", "start": 9884, "end": 9911, "line": 242}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-10188", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-10188", "text": "'This phone cannot do it'", "sha256": "d8cbc2b8f364f7e5e2226ee982f226c608b8c4d63921b0958d08d790f2a52918", "kind": "dart", "start": 10188, "end": 10213, "line": 250}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-10290", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-10290", "text": "'Reading which app posted a notification is an Android '\n'capability. iOS gives no app that access, including '\n'this one.'", "sha256": "95da37e9e0473f28eb35f05ad2584018afa030bb95492b0c9444458ed0297013", "kind": "dart", "start": 10290, "end": 10469, "line": 252}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-10781", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-10781", "text": "'Buzz on app notifications'", "sha256": "fee0a57f825dc2ff79046236fdc1f043a1e318059276289ea2da69aa20c0e836", "kind": "dart", "start": 10781, "end": 10808, "line": 261}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-11431", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-11431", "text": "'The strap buzzes when one of the apps below '\n'notifies you. What a notification says is never '\n'read or sent — only which app posted, kept on '\n'this phone to build the list'", "sha256": "71216f3fdbd9e7453b065b09e64619fdd29429f087b3659c04aee5f5d0738e2d", "kind": "dart", "start": 11431, "end": 11704, "line": 270}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-12265", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-12265", "text": "'One buzz, not a stream'", "sha256": "cd4c0c3d52540c853fea87d78545736694097c39097dcf6535d5670358bbd607", "kind": "dart", "start": 12265, "end": 12289, "line": 284}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-12311", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-12311", "text": "'An update to a notification never buzzes again; a new '\n'one does. Ongoing notifications (media players, '\n'downloads) never buzz, and nothing buzzes while the '\n'band is disconnected unless you choose the phone '\n'alert below.'", "sha256": "4e796d5a218d4684e27e6afcade4fa458daf5f448ee0d8db017c346e27d19442", "kind": "dart", "start": 12311, "end": 12636, "line": 285}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-12913", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-12913", "text": "'Android needs to let us see notifications'", "sha256": "9eca5b0c4a538c94f8a22cd8c9b3b77c59497d9975c53399b3829e5a73763139", "kind": "dart", "start": 12913, "end": 12956, "line": 296}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart:offset-13036", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/band_notifications.dart", "location": "offset-13036", "text": "'The permission says which app posted, and that is all '\n'this uses it for. The names stay on this phone and '\n'nothing leaves it.'", "sha256": "06fc276d701802681e53043eb9f0ed045facb606d176441e6b393f116c1fa402", "kind": "dart", "start": 13036, "end": 13227, "line": 298}
