{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/data.dart:offset-11054", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/data.dart", "location": "offset-11054", "text": "'One .db file. Lossless, and the only format that '\n'restores onto another phone. Readable by anything '\n'that opens SQLite — including anyone who gets the '\n'file'", "sha256": "c78661a09606a76b33efe5e58176bd66655623017e3f9ce8d321e64d6845bbcd", "kind": "dart", "start": 11054, "end": 11308, "line": 271}
