{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/data.dart:offset-11591", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/data.dart", "location": "offset-11591", "text": "'The same complete copy, sealed with a passphrase, '\n'for somewhere like iCloud. Forget the passphrase '\n'and that file is gone — there is no recovery, '\n'because there is no account holding a key'", "sha256": "37e4336122b69a4ee68ad92efae5a262487c52b27b0863938560e932d1821573", "kind": "dart", "start": 11591, "end": 11878, "line": 279}
